    <h2>What one extra call a week is worth</h2>
    <p>Webflow comes closest to custom code in quality, so the case here is narrower. In a worked example for a typical local business, a $500 average job and one extra call a week come to $26,000 a year in potential work. If you depend on Google's map results and your traffic is growing, the higher speed, deeper local search control, and flat price of custom code fit better. If not, Webflow is fine.</p>

